WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.885 --> 00:00:15.272
Lord stood in the center of the shop.

2
00:00:16.353 --> 00:00:18.534
Master Crossland knelt beside him.

3
00:00:19.555 --> 00:00:22.737
He was measuring the lord's leg from the knee to the foot.

4
00:00:22.757 --> 00:00:27.900
"We have very nice silk from Italy," said the tailor.

5
00:00:29.208 --> 00:00:32.390
"Edward, please show the golden silk to Lord Crumley."

6
00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:36.252
Edward carried the silk over to Lord Crumley.

7
00:00:37.473 --> 00:00:39.273
The nobleman hardly looked at it.

8
00:00:39.293 --> 00:00:41.735
"Is that all?"

9
00:00:42.695 --> 00:00:44.336
he yawned in a bored voice.

10
00:00:44.356 --> 00:00:46.697
"Ouch! Be careful!

11
00:00:47.078 --> 00:00:48.238
You've pinched my leg!"

12
00:00:48.819 --> 00:00:50.139
he yelled at the tailor.

13
00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:52.380
Then he kicked him.

14
00:00:53.521 --> 00:00:56.603
Edward put down the silk and jumped on a nearby stool.

15
00:00:59.212 --> 00:01:01.113
"How dare you treat my master like that!"

16
00:01:01.834 --> 00:01:04.535
shouted Edward in his most dramatic voice.

17
00:01:04.555 --> 00:01:07.117
"Have you no shame?

18
00:01:07.677 --> 00:01:08.717
Have you no pity?"

19
00:01:08.738 --> 00:01:12.540
"Ssh, Edward," said the tailor.

20
00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:13.840
"Get down."

21
00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.202
"What are you doing?"

22
00:01:16.862 --> 00:01:18.463
whispered Vinnie to Edward.

23
00:01:19.504 --> 00:01:22.806
Lord Crumley was angry and turned bright red.

24
00:01:23.786 --> 00:01:26.008
He looked as if his head would explode.

25
00:01:28.168 --> 00:01:31.550
"My lord, I'm so sorry," said the tailor.

26
00:01:31.570 --> 00:01:34.491
"My apprentice didn't mean to upset you."

27
00:01:34.511 --> 00:01:37.912
"This is your apprentice?"

28
00:01:38.513 --> 00:01:39.833
shouted Lord Crumley.

29
00:01:39.853 --> 00:01:41.694
"Throw him out immediately!"

30
00:01:41.714 --> 00:01:46.696
"But, my lord, he's just a boy," said the tailor.

31
00:01:46.716 --> 00:01:49.037
"Toss him into the streets!"

32
00:01:49.577 --> 00:01:50.898
cried the angry man.

33
00:01:50.918 --> 00:01:52.719
"That's fine!"

34
00:01:53.239 --> 00:01:54.039
shouted Edward.

35
00:01:54.059 --> 00:01:55.720
"I'll leave.

36
00:01:56.272 --> 00:01:59.514
I won't spend my life measuring cloth for lords and ladies.

37
00:02:00.115 --> 00:02:00.955
Come on, Vinnie!"

38
00:02:02.236 --> 00:02:05.958
Edward grabbed Vinnie's arm and they both ran out of the shop.

39
00:02:07.599 --> 00:02:12.562
At that same moment, Mandy and Lady Katherine were also leaving the house.

40
00:02:12.582 --> 00:02:16.425
"Have you been to the Globe Theater, Mandy?"

41
00:02:17.025 --> 00:02:18.266
asked Lady Katherine.

42
00:02:18.286 --> 00:02:21.648
"No, my lady," replied Mandy.

43
00:02:22.844 --> 00:02:28.606
"William Shakespeare and his actors are performing a great play," said Lady Katherine.

44
00:02:28.626 --> 00:02:31.287
"It is called Romeo and Juliet.

45
00:02:31.728 --> 00:02:32.648
Would you like to go?"

46
00:02:32.668 --> 00:02:37.510
"You are so kind to me, Lady Katherine," said Mandy.

47
00:02:38.550 --> 00:02:40.411
Lady Katherine smiled at her.

48
00:02:40.431 --> 00:02:47.214
"If you don't have a family, you may stay at my home," she said.

49
00:02:47.234 --> 00:02:49.435
"You will be treated well."

50
00:02:49.455 --> 00:02:55.293
"Thank you but Mandy could not finish her answer.

51
00:02:56.393 --> 00:02:58.034
She was thinking about Vinnie.

52
00:02:58.054 --> 00:03:00.154
"Where is he?"

53
00:03:00.774 --> 00:03:01.555
she wondered.

54
00:03:02.875 --> 00:03:05.936
Then Mandy and Lady Katherine got in the carriage.

55
00:03:07.296 --> 00:03:10.197
Edward and Vinnie were running fast through the streets.

56
00:03:11.598 --> 00:03:14.699
Edward ran down lanes and jumped over fences.

57
00:03:15.859 --> 00:03:18.380
Vinnie had a hard time keeping up with him.

58
00:03:20.256 --> 00:03:23.899
Finally, Edward stopped on the corner of a wide street.

59
00:03:23.919 --> 00:03:28.563
"Vinnie, do you want to see something wonderful?"

60
00:03:29.143 --> 00:03:31.065
said Edward, out of breath.

61
00:03:32.106 --> 00:03:32.986
"What do you mean?"

62
00:03:33.607 --> 00:03:34.267
asked Vinnie.

63
00:03:34.287 --> 00:03:38.831
"England has more than just servants and lords," shouted the boy.

64
00:03:38.851 --> 00:03:40.613
"We have the theater!"

65
00:03:40.633 --> 00:03:45.857
"But isn't Master Crossland going to be angry?"

66
00:03:46.557 --> 00:03:47.198
asked Vinnie.

67
00:03:48.219 --> 00:03:49.520
Edward wasn't listening.

68
00:03:50.424 --> 00:03:52.245
"We're finally going to the Globe, Vinnie!"

69
00:03:52.685 --> 00:03:53.186
he said.

70
00:03:53.206 --> 00:03:54.307
"Follow me!"
